        <mxCell id="ge_box" value="&lt;b&gt;Gemini Enterprise Web App (Engine)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;hr/&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px;&quot;&gt;• Default Assistant (All 5 DataStores Blended)&lt;br/&gt;• Workflow 1: Ad-Copy Compliance Pre-Review (Sequential)&lt;br/&gt;• Agent 2: Sales &amp;amp; Inventory Risk Analysis (Low-Code)&lt;br/&gt;• Workflow 3: VOC &amp;amp; Quality Claim Escalation (Sequential)&lt;br/&gt;• Canvas Local Export (.docx / .pdf / .pptx / .html)&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#FB8C00;strokeWidth=2;align=left;spacingLeft=12;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=10;fontColor=#202124;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="lane_ai">
