        <mxCell id="iam_box" value="&lt;b&gt;IAM &amp;amp; AI Developer Tools Governance&lt;/b&gt;&lt;hr/&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:11px;&quot;&gt;• Custom Role: geStandardChatUser (129 perms, 0 agy)&lt;br/&gt;• Developer Role: roles/discoveryengine.agentspaceUser&lt;br/&gt;• Outside File = Deny · Terminal = Require Review&lt;br/&gt;• Sandbox = Enabled · MCP Allowlist JSON&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#FFF3E0;strokeColor=#E65100;strokeWidth=2;align=left;spacingLeft=12;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=10;fontColor=#202124;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="lane_ai">
