        <mxCell id="note_trial" value="&lt;b&gt;30-Day Free-Trial Eligibility Note:&lt;/b&gt; Gemini Enterprise Web App &amp;amp; 1P DataStores support 30-day Free-Trial across all billing accounts. Google Antigravity (AI developer tools) is included in 30-day Free-Trial on &lt;b&gt;Invoiced Billing Accounts&lt;/b&gt;; Self-serve online accounts require an active non-trial subscription (Standard, Plus, or Pay-as-you-go with Prepaid Credits)." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#FFF9C4;strokeColor=#FBC02D;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#5F4B00;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=left;spacingLeft=14;" vertex="1" parent="1">
